=== PART 2: is the arc-interaction graph A(T) a finer invariant than H? ===
n=5: 1024 labeled tournaments
  distinct H-values:                 7
  distinct (H, A(T)-degree-seq):      10
  => A(T) degree sequence REFINES H.
     H=3: split into 2 A(T)-classes (sizes [80, 40])
     H=9: split into 2 A(T)-classes (sizes [120, 120])
     H=15: split into 2 A(T)-classes (sizes [40, 24])
